{"3235150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exile Protocol", "steam_appid": 3235150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> First-Person CO-OP Shooter </strong>that has<strong> Unforgiving, Hardcore, Horror, Looting, Extraction </strong>elements with<strong> Procedural Generation</strong> and<strong> Perma-Death. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong> Welcome to <i><strong>Exile Protocol</strong></i>, a heart-pounding sci-fi first-person shooter that thrusts you and your friends into the depths of procedurally generated bunkers teeming with nightmarish creatures. In this brutal world, survival is the only goal, and every decision could mean the difference between life and permanent death.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/9f42a9232b6b77e18b7b9de49188024f.avif?t=1781850161\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras_big/9f42a9232b6b77e18b7b9de49188024f.avif?t=1781850161 width=800 height=128 /></span> <strong> </strong>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/e267d860ca47d4954af2cb35145bf3ab.poster.avif?t=1781850161\" width=750 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/e267d860ca47d4954af2cb35145bf3ab.webm?t=1781850161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Online Co-op:</strong> Play solo, or team up with friends to strategize and tackle challenges together, enhancing your chances of survival and making every run an unforgettable adventure. Fully immerse yourself with proximity voice chat. Proximity voice alters your voice depending on your environment (adds reverb when in bunkers).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With friends by your side, you’ll balance risk and reward. Do you sneak past a lurking monster to secure a rare weapon, or do you engage in a firefight, knowing that the noise could attract even more deadly foes? The loot you gather will be vital not only for your immediate survival but also for enhancing your team’s abilities and gear for future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/b8303553168ba8c784dc4839436e631f.avif?t=1781850161\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras_big/b8303553168ba8c784dc4839436e631f.avif?t=1781850161 width=800 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/e8b3ce62608f5bce859074658ef841da.poster.avif?t=1781850161\" width=750 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/e8b3ce62608f5bce859074658ef841da.webm?t=1781850161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Varied Monsters:</strong> Encounter a diverse array of horrifying creatures, each with unique strengths and weaknesses.  Some creatures are adept at detecting sound, while others are drawn to light or have acute vision. Communicate effectively to adapt your tactics and outsmart these beasts. Learn their behaviors to survive and loot effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/ea03caf2bd7cf81bd24afeb8d1c7f4c0.avif?t=1781850161\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras_big/ea03caf2bd7cf81bd24afeb8d1c7f4c0.avif?t=1781850161 width=800 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/e1f7b3bf4b4e9341025e5822c0bda5bd.poster.avif?t=1781850161\" width=750 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/e1f7b3bf4b4e9341025e5822c0bda5bd.webm?t=1781850161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Dynamic Loot System:</strong> Collect a wide range of weapons, gear, and resources to enhance your characters and increase your chances of extraction. Each piece of gear contains different stats to help your style of gameplay. Stats include health, stamina, stealth (noise suppression), accuracy, stability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Bunkers:</strong> Each expedition offers a fresh experience, with layouts, loot, and monster placements changing every time you enter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Tension Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in a haunting soundscape and visual design that keeps your adrenaline pumping as you creep through the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perma-Death Mechanics:</strong> In <i><strong>Exile Protocol</strong></i>, death is final. Each run presents a new challenge, and when one of you falls, that character is lost forever. This high-stakes mechanic amplifies the tension for your entire team, making every choice carry weight. Will you take calculated risks together, or play it safe? The choice is yours, but be ready for the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Loadout: </strong>Equip a combination of different guns, scopes, magazines, suppressors and laser sights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Player voices will be altered to match the environment (Reverb added to make players sound like they are inside a bunker). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screen-Altering Effects: </strong>Poison / Toxic screen effects. These effects can also alter sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong> Your mission is clear: explore the eerie depths of the bunkers, collect valuable loot, and extract safely—all while working as a team. But tread carefully—every shadow could conceal a predator, and every sound could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you and your friends ready to face the horrors of <i>Exile Protocol</i>? The bunkers are waiting, and the monsters are hungry. Will you emerge victorious, or will you become just another name on the list of the lost? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras/904ac92745bd7f559a3c4b7f369d2d3f.avif?t=1781850161\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235150/extras_big/904ac92745bd7f559a3c4b7f369d2d3f.avif?t=1781850161 width=800 height=128 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> First-Person CO-OP Shooter </strong>that has<strong> Unforgiving, Hardcore, Horror, Looting, Extraction </strong>elements with<strong> Procedural Generation</strong> and<strong> Perma-Death. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong> Welcome to <i><strong>Exile Protocol</strong></i>, a heart-pounding sci-fi first-person shooter that thrusts you and your friends into the depths of procedurally generated bunkers teeming with nightmarish creatures. In this brutal world, survival is the only goal, and every decision could